# Voice-over DELIVERY folders dropped inside the build's asset tree.
#
# The lesson plays assets/Audio/VO/<id>.ogg - flat, one file per audio id. A delivery arrives as
# a folder of .wav next to them, which is raw material: 30 MB that the lesson never reads, and
# that `git add .` would otherwise commit and deploy.
# Convert what is wanted into assets/Audio/VO/<id>.ogg; leave the folder here as the source.
3_CURRENT_BUILD/assets/Audio/VO/*/

# Office lock files (~$Name.pptx) from a deck being open while the repo is committed
~$*

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
